Package: vehicle-computer-runtime
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Heejong Jo <me@whipaper.net>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: adduser, libc6, libdw1t64, libgcc-s1, libgnutls30t64, liblttng-ust1t64, libstdc++6, libudev1, libunwind8, libyaml-0-2
Description: Platform runtime for the ROS 2 vehicle computer
 Pinned Raspberry Pi libcamera runtime, systemd unit, and preserved
 configuration files used by the vehicle computer deployment.
